{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20568","headline":"送从弟蒙赴饶州 · 张籍","name":"送从弟蒙赴饶州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"京城南去鄱阳远，风月悠悠别思劳。\n三领郡符新寄重，再登科第旧名高。\n去程江上多看堠，迎吏船中亦带刀。\n到日更行清静化，春田应不见蓬蒿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}